>Nishioka</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>An epitope in hepatitis C virus core region recognized by cytotoxic T cells in mice and humans</article-title><source>J Virol</source><year>1994</year><volume>68</volume><fpage>3334</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7512163</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>van Endert</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Designing peptide vaccines for cellular cross-presentation</article-title><source>Biologicals</source><year>2001</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>285</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11851329</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>